{"id":"pdfunite.1","n":"pdfunite","s":"1","src":{"r":{"pkg":"poppler-utils","ver":"21.01.0-21.el9","repo":"AppStream","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/AppStream/x86_64/os/Packages/p/poppler-utils-21.01.0-21.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/pdfunite.1.gz","sha256":"ac57b8a13a8b0abe5a7d8f1fb1bade77e60adf9710e83b3f6ba7606a6d9fd6cc","date":"15 September 2011","origin":""},"u":{"pkg":"poppler-utils","ver":"22.02.0-2ubuntu0.15","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/p/poppler/poppler-utils_22.02.0-2ubuntu0.15_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man1/pdfunite.1.gz","sha256":"2a51ac8e1fa1db1754509ecd26dda45b11783030dab4f7fc88dc2027536b2cd0","date":"15 September 2011","origin":""}},"nopt":{"r":2,"u":2},"desc":"Portable Document Format (PDF) page merger","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>pdfunite - Portable Document Format (PDF) page merger</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<p><b>pdfunite</b> [options] <i>PDF-sourcefile1..PDF-sourcefilen PDF-destfile</i></p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p><b>pdfunite</b> merges several PDF (Portable Document Format) files in order of their occurrence on command line to one PDF result file.</p> <dl><dt>Neither of the PDF-sourcefile1 to PDF-sourcefilen should be encrypted.</dt><dd></dd></dl>"],["OPTIONS","<dl><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-v</b></dt><dd>Print copyright and version information.</dd><dt data-o=\"\"><b>-h</b></dt><dd>Print usage information. (<b>-help</b> and <b>--help</b> are equivalent.)</dd></dl>"],["EXAMPLE","<p>pdfunite sample1.pdf sample2.pdf sample.pdf</p> <dl><dt>merges all pages from sample1.pdf and sample2.pdf (in that order) and creates sample.pdf</dt><dd></dd></dl>"],["AUTHOR","<p>The pdfunite software and documentation are copyright 1996-2004 Glyph &amp; Cog, LLC and copyright 2005-2011 The Poppler Developers - http://poppler.freedesktop.org</p>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>pdfdetach</b>(1), <b>pdffonts</b>(1), <b>pdfimages</b>(1), <b>pdfinfo</b>(1), <b>pdftocairo</b>(1), <b>pdftohtml</b>(1), <b>pdftoppm</b>(1), <b>pdftops</b>(1), <b>pdftotext</b>(1) <b>pdfseparate</b>(1), <b>pdfsig</b>(1)</p>"]]}